  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>A small, dark, irregular body on a retrograde and steeply inclined orbit, captured rather than formed here and compositionally unlike everything else in the system. It tumbles rather than rotates and has no stable pole. Two attempts to land were abandoned before descent.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
